          "output_tokens": 193,
          "input_tokens": 3570,
          "text": "To give **Writer** access to a folder of documents:\n\n1. In **Notes**, upload the folder using **Upload to store**.\n2. Use **Copy Ref ID** on the stored folder to copy its CHA Ref ID.\n3. Go to **Characters \u2192 Writer \u2192 Character settings \u2192 Files \u2192 New file**.\n4. Choose **Folder reference**, enter the Ref ID, and save.\n\nThis adds the folder to Writer\u2019s configured files, rather than attaching it only to one chat. Characters using network providers search referenced folders while answering. Adding or removing a Files reference does **not** restart running chats.\n\nFor a single document already in Notes, choose **Note reference** instead; a chat copies the referenced note when it first uses it.\n\n**Removal:** Remove the entry from Writer\u2019s **Files** to revoke that reference. The chat command `/detach <Ref ID>` removes only a folder attached in that chat\u2014not a Files reference.",
